  "summary": "Install-time system information exfiltration in @apexfdn/apex",
  "details": "The package ships an install.cjs lifecycle script that, on npm install, imports the os and https modules, reads process.env and process.platform, and transmits host/environment information over HTTPS to a non-registry destination. The behavior fires automatically as part of the package install lifecycle and has no relation to a documented package purpose, matching the shape of an install-time environment exfiltration beacon rather than legitimate build or telemetry activity.",
